                                <color key="backgroundColor" systemColor="systemBackgroundColor"/>
                                <string key="text">Game works: Twintails in Battlefield, Punishing Gray Raven.                                                                    Introduction: The former of KURO GAME was called KURO Zhuhai which was founded in 2014. KURO GAME is an internet culture company which is intended to develop two-dimension games and incubate original IPs.                                                      </string>
